  "description": "ILESUN crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C210 H289 Eu7 O35 S6,10(C2 H3 N1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu7 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.876-3.939 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.27-109.44°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C230H323Eu7N10O37S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
